      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm looking at ticket #88291 regarding that shattered ceramic vase. The customer is demanding a full refund immediately and seems pretty upset. I see the carrier logs show no mishandling during transit, but the customer's claim is pretty direct. Based on the carrier data and the customer's claim, what's the most efficient way to handle this to ensure we don't lose the customer but also minimize unnecessary costs?",
